## Ory Stack — Modular Self-hosted Auth

Kratos (identity management) + Hydra (OAuth2/OIDC server). Best for microservices where separation of concerns matters.

### docker-compose.ory.yml

```yaml
version: '3.8'
services:
  kratos-migrate:
    image: oryd/kratos:latest
    command: migrate sql -e --yes
    environment:
      DSN: postgres://kratos:${PG_PASS}@postgresql:5432/kratos?sslmode=disable
    depends_on: [postgresql]

  kratos:
    image: oryd/kratos:latest
    ports:
      - '4433:4433'   # Public API
      - '4434:4434'   # Admin API
    command: serve --config /etc/config/kratos.yml
    volumes:
      - ./kratos:/etc/config
    environment:
      DSN: postgres://kratos:${PG_PASS}@postgresql:5432/kratos?sslmode=disable
    depends_on: [kratos-migrate]
    restart: unless-stopped

  hydra:
    image: oryd/hydra:latest
    ports:
      - '4444:4444'   # Public API
      - '4445:4445'   # Admin API
    command: serve all --dangerous-force-http
    environment:
      DSN: postgres://hydra:${PG_PASS}@postgresql:5432/hydra?sslmode=disable
      SECRETS_SYSTEM: ${HYDRA_SYSTEM_SECRET}
      URLS_SELF_ISSUER: http://localhost:4444
      URLS_CONSENT: http://localhost:3000/consent
      URLS_LOGIN: http://localhost:3000/login
    depends_on: [postgresql]
    restart: unless-stopped

  postgresql:
    image: postgres:16
    environment:
      POSTGRES_MULTIPLE_DATABASES: kratos,hydra
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${PG_PASS}
    volumes:
      - ory-db:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    restart: unless-stopped

volumes:
  ory-db:
```

### Environment variables

```env
PG_PASS=<random-db-password>
HYDRA_SYSTEM_SECRET=<random-32-char-secret>
ORY_KRATOS_PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:4433
ORY_HYDRA_PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:4444
```
